        ><div class="irjQI3wcbx7yHDn5H" data-instant-type="container"></div><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ijwjqLkN8qZGt6H2X"><h1>I Lost Over 100 Pounds. Here&apos;s The Water Routine I Still Use To Keep It Off.</h1></div
        ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iNaJS3OZBfytTvrXa"><p>After years of fighting my weight, a trip to Japan completely changed the way I thought about weight loss. What started as something a friend showed me eventually became The Special Water.</p></div
        ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iauzCcjwYaO5EW6dn"><p>Emily Carter — Founder of The Special Water</p></div
        ><a class="iaCyGFXfyEmwfINqA" data-instant-type="container" href="#iFCI4xDpF51Uyo7uB" data-instant-action-type="scroll-to-section" data-instant-action-id="FCI4xDpF51Uyo7uB"
