            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iegrnETy9vPmTVps7"><h2>Then I Went To Japan.</h2></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ixyJKj5r6N0hjuH4D"><p>While I was in Japan, a friend put me onto something I had never heard of before — Japanese weight-loss water.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ik8RjpbBVddWuM0KY"><p>I started drinking it and loved the concept.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ipSDJW0E2yPkFQ4uX"><p>I ended up losing around 15 pounds.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ieQ0zFrrdGLQxRPkZ"><p>But because I already had experience building products and businesses, I couldn&apos;t stop thinking about one thing.</p></div></div
