          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ij0Iae4AyN1BkGfBu"><p>From Japan To The Lab</p></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ingjUXKdOfpj4H96E"><h2>So I Started Researching.</h2></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iEn16XZSNwtofgQUt"><p>I started digging into the botanicals behind the concept and eventually worked with a lab to create my own version.</p></div
