        ><div class="i4J4rhOhLZVqIu9XV" data-instant-type="container"
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iav0noE1hXBzPafNH"><p>THE FORMULA</p></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iAvdZvgHn7h4AhpHP"><h2>6 Powerful Botanicals. Zero Herbal Taste.</h2></div
          ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iV1E1B978jLzjIkUW"><p>We took six bold botanical extracts and formulated them to virtually disappear into your water—so you get the ritual without turning your favorite water into some nasty herbal drink.</p></div
