              ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iv7cDYuJKdniWyNhh"><p>01</p></div
              ><div class="iUFZGl06mYrR5S9Us" data-instant-type="container"></div></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iLmXBDhvGMm7L1npb"><h3>Cinnamomum Cassia Bark</h3></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iU2OQ9zkL5cSFfu5E"><p>The blood-sugar-support botanical.</p></div
            ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iftIHmoz6gX2bwypJ"
              ><p>Cinnamomum cassia has a long history of use in traditional wellness and has been researched for its role in supporting healthy glucose metabolism and insulin sensitivity. Normally it comes with an unmistakably strong cinnamon bite. <strong>We wanted the botanical—not cinnamon-flavored water.</strong> So we formulated it into the blend without letting that powerful flavor take over your drink.</p></div
            ></div
          ></div
